            "target_entity_instance": "CoCiP",
            "target_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "paragraph": "For this study, we use the CoCiP version that was adapted for Python in the pycontrails package, version 0.54.6 (Shapiro et al., 2025). The nominal predicted energy forcing of contrails is estimated using the default parameters of pycontrails and the nominal weather forecast.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
